# Inbound port mapping requested from the router by UPnP. Optional: a site
# with a static address or a hand-configured forward needs none of this.
#
# The timer interval must be SHORTER than LEASE, or the mapping expires
# between runs.
#
# WAN_IF is detected from the default route when unset. PORT and PROTO are
# rewritten by `vpn-server set-port`, which is why they belong in a file
# rather than in the unit.
#WAN_IF=
PORT=1194
PROTO=UDP
LEASE=3600
DESC=openvpn
# Optional fallback if the router will not report its external address.
# Naming one is a choice about which third party sees the request.
#CHECKIP_URL=
